===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{recons|arga-|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{recons|h₁ergʰ-|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{term|arg|lang=ofs}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|arg|lang=goh}}, Dutch {{term|erg|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|non|-}} {{term|argr|lang=non}} (Swedish, Danish {{term|arg|lang=sv}}).

